                "text": "Yes, and on two of the three tracks it is the optimal play: welding years keep feeding CWI and API eligibility while you study. The exception is the ASNT method-hours requirement — those accrue only in NDT assignments — which is why career-changers often move to a dual welder/QC role or an NDT trainee position partway through rather than at the start."
